selected_candidate.shim_pattern_recommendation:
Define each shim as a one-line method on BrainSession that delegates to the standalone function, e.g.:
  def _is_dashboard_query(self, message: str) -> bool:
      return _qp.is_dashboard_query(message)
where `_qp` is the module alias `from brain_v9.core import session_query_predicates as _qp`.

Alternative considered: assign as classmethod/staticmethod via class-attr assignment after class body. Less idiomatic, more error-prone in inheritance, REJECTED.
